_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MFQkJcvSULcQ7kNvwGZTIeA&_nc_oc=AdkTi5jdebshuTGqtGraV3zh7oVpbJZkM0TgHgkJyG3Cm4ECZ3rShNl3wO_8ttuOlVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyuaW9qrmiXABUkvRiMO4riQrRoIWSJyB32Oor5oIXgCQ&oe=69AEB44C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vidthumb.png", "id": "419702353686012", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031447_419702357019345_1078684321555486491_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UyXC4KPyyXkQ7kNvwG6A8kT&_nc_oc=AdmaBkNvs4hd-rIEXt8Ke6F_FqLCAaugeoRyG8u6bRTFbeAtUd7X-reoo9OZZGfvRng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzkuWvQ_kxCknOsAniTFA865Xo4zi7-kKC-NS2TfHbyqg&oe=69AEAE40"}, "display_name": "FloatVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u2605WHAT WILL YOU EXPERIENCE TODAY?\u2605\nFLOAT through a world generated anew every time you visit.\nLISTEN music arranged and composed especially for you. \nEXPAND your perspective with spoken observations.\nDISCOVER rare creatures and interactive objects.\n\u2193\n\u2605 HEALING: Experience an instant feeling of wellness\n\u2605 EVER CHANGING: Never experience the same thing twice\n\u2605 INFINITE: stay as long as you like.\n\u2193\nWhen you need to reset and recharge...\nWhen you need a break from your own thoughts...\nWhen you need to just BE...\nFLOAT IS ALWAYS HERE FOR YOU.  ", "short_description": "\u2605WHAT WILL YOU EXPERIENCE TODAY?\u2605\nFLOAT through a world generated anew every time you visit.\nLISTEN music arranged and composed especially for you. \nEXPAND your perspective with spoken observations.\nWATCH strange creatures doing their thing. \n\u2193\n\u2605 HEALING: Experience an instant feeling of wellness\n\u2605 EVER CHANGING: Never experience the same thing twice\n\u2605 INFINITE: stay as long as you like.\n\u2193\nWhen you need a break from your own thoughts...\nFLOAT IS ALWAYS HERE FOR YOU.  "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privac